# Deployment-local configuration for ProtForge.
#
# Copy this file to `scripts/local.env` and fill it in. `local.env` is listed in
# .gitignore, so anything you put here stays on your machine and is never
# published with the repository.
#
# Values here are plain shell assignments; the file is sourced by
# scripts/_common.sh before any path is resolved.

# Space-separated roots probed, in order, when neither PROTORGE_HOME nor the
# legacy OIH_HOME is set. The first one that exists on disk wins. Leave unset
# to use the single documented default (E:/protforge).
#PROTFORGE_CANDIDATES="E:/protforge E:/my-deployment-root"

# Fallback returned when no candidate directory exists. Change this if your
# deployment root is not on the E: drive.
#PROTFORGE_DEFAULT_ROOT="E:/protforge"

# Extra model roots for the ESMFold2 scripts (skills/protforge-esmfold2), in
# WSL path form, colon-separated. Probed after ESMFOLD2_WEIGHTS and the
# built-in candidates.
#ESMFOLD2_MODELS_ROOTS="/mnt/e/my-deployment-root/models"